Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:15:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s developer image: speakers, microphones, headphone jack,
 always-on trackpad

linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora16.j714s3-4 adds linux-aurora-n1 0011-0012 (the
J714s audio nodes and sound card, the trackpad AFE reset) and the AOP
audio drivers; omarchy-aurora-firmware 20261014.j714s3 ships the J714
speaker-safety profile and speaker/microphone graphs (edimoldovan). Both
from betizzel/omarchy-m5 installer/recipes (fef2f8ef).
